    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol., 2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAs">V As</ref> Prol., 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heo man æfre eft on earde gemete, ðæt hy sýn swa scyldige, swa se ðe æt hæbbendre handa gefongan sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone ever meets them afterwards in their native district, they shall be liable to the same punishment as one who is taken in the act of thieving.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif hi mon æfre eft on ðæm eorda gemitte, þæt hi syn swa scyldig, swa se ðe æt hebbendra handa gefongen syn.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
